1. Open main.py
• Open the file in your editor

2. Add FastAPI app
• Write:
  • from fastapi import FastAPI
  • app = FastAPI()

3. Create your first route
• Add below:
  • @app.get("/test")
  • def test_route():
      return {"message": "API is working"}

4. Run the server
• In terminal (inside C:\fastapi and venv activated):
  • uvicorn main:app --reload

5. Test it
• Open browser:
  • http://127.0.0.1:8000/test

Expected output
• {"message": "API is working"}
